        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Enhance HTMLFormControlsCollection description]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40841</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40841"/>
        <updated>2025-08-22T10:37:48.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">Added details about the elements included in the HTMLFormControlsCollection.</p>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto">The elements IDL attribute must return an <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/common-dom-interfaces.html#htmlformcontrolscollection" rel="nofollow">HTMLFormControlsCollection</a> rooted at the <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#the-form-element" rel="nofollow">form</a> element's <a href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root" rel="nofollow">root</a>, whose filter matches <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#category-listed" rel="nofollow">listed elements</a> whose <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#form-owner" rel="nofollow">form owner</a> is the <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#the-form-element" rel="nofollow">form</a> element, with the exception of <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#the-input-element" rel="nofollow">input</a> elements whose <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#attr-input-type" rel="nofollow">type</a> attribute is in the <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#image-button-state-(type=image)" rel="nofollow">Image Button</a> state, which must, for historical reasons, be excluded from this particular collection.</p>
</blockquote>
<p dir="auto">related to <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3327682986" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40760" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/40760/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40760">#40760</a></p>]]></content>
