<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>

<p dir="auto">Adds <code class="notranslate">form</code> HTML attribute, providing all the supported elements with links for <code class="notranslate">form</code> attribute.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<p dir="auto">These changes ensure that <code class="notranslate">form</code> attribute have its own standalone page and help the reader know about this attribute in a centralized place.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>

<p dir="auto">This PR might need <code class="notranslate">label</code>, <code class="notranslate">meter</code>, and <code class="notranslate">progress</code> BCD updates. Plus, these elements <code class="notranslate">meter</code> , <code class="notranslate">object</code> , <code class="notranslate">output</code> might have limited support or no support at all after some research.</p>
